	(text "SAM_IO, derived from PPUC IO_16_8_1 v1.1.1 (TAPR OHL 1.0, see ../README.md):\n- IN16 (16 inputs, J6-J8) and OUT8 (8 high-power outputs, J9-J11, F2, C56) removed.\n- MCU is an RP2354B (2 MB internal flash, QFN-80); the RP2040 and the W25Q flash are gone. QSPI pins unused, QSPI_SS kept for BOOTSEL.\n- GPIO3-18 drive the SAM bus through level shifters on sheet 'SAM bus' (J9 to the SAM IO board J1).\n- GPIO19-24, 26, 27 = dedicated D17-D24, GPIO30-37 = D9-D16, GPIO38 = coin door memory protect (sheet 'Dedicated switches').\n- GPIO25 LED, GPIO29 special output. Board address (SW3) moved to GPIO40/ADC0. SWD header is now J20."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 297.18 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "53fff17f-78c0-4991-a5b0-807142ea71af")
	)
