	(text "RP2354B core supply (RP2350 switching regulator, values as on the SAM CPU board):\nL1 3.3 uH from VREG_LX to DVDD (1V1), C36 4.7 uF output cap, VREG_FB to DVDD.\nVREG_AVDD through R31 33 R with C34 4.7 uF. Keep L1/C36/C35 tight to the chip."
